      "sourceTextSha256": "d0f4f5591a91185e98f56b339ebf3bd8e74d87a5636dec34fdab8757c9d54137",
      "text": "Day 14 · Drive towards the Peruvian border, visiting the ruins of Tiwanaku, one of the oldest civilisations of South America, which flourished on the Altiplano in the first millennium AD: the Gate of the Sun, the Kalasasaya temple and the pyramids. From Desaguadero, on the border, transfer to Puno. In the afternoon, the Uros floating islands, built of totora reeds, where the islanders preserve their traditional way of life (with an English-speaking guide).",
